# Rule 1762 (fleet research): LF-only line endings, repo-wide.
# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever the
# platform; binary assets are marked so no conversion ever touches them.
* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.wav binary
*.cube text eol=lf
